Center the title text also when TitleStyle Height (or MinHeight) makes
the title bar smaller than the font's natural height. Before, the text
offset was adjusted only when the bar grew, so a smaller bar cut off the
bottom of the text. Negative values are rounded down like positive ones
(the odd pixel goes below the text in both cases).

--- fvwm/geometry.c.orig
+++ fvwm/geometry.c
@@ -302,6 +302,10 @@
 	{
 		*offset += extra_size / 2;
 	}
+	else if (extra_size < 0)
+	{
+		*offset -= (1 - extra_size) / 2;
+	}
 	*size = font_size + extra_size;
 
 	return;
